  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "The text frames Al Gore and Stuart Stevens as Ethical Stabilizers (specifically the 'Virtuous' or 'Guardian' sub-role) by highlighting their adherence to legal and ethical standards. They are portrayed as upholding justice and proper procedure by reporting suspicious foreign contact to law enforcement, contrasting them with the Trump campaign's failure to do so."
