    "explanation": "The text frames the Green Party and Jill Stein as actors seeking to 'ensure the integrity of the U.S. voting system' and protect the 'accuracy, security and fairness of our elections.' This aligns with the Guardian sub-role, where they are positioned as upholders of democratic values and procedural justice, even if their efforts are contested."
  },
  "Altruistic_Catalysts": {
