  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "Donald Trump is framed as a Guardian who seeks to protect the American people and uphold justice by enforcing immigration laws. The text highlights his stated priority to 'protect the American people' and prevent harm, positioning him as a defender of community safety against external threats."
