    "explanation": "Judge Mark Goldsmith is framed as a Guardian and Virtuous figure who upholds justice and safety by halting deportations to prevent harm. The ACLU lawyers are also portrayed as Guardians/Virtuous actors advocating for human rights and legal protection against persecution, utilizing established legal values to maintain social cohesion and protect vulnerable individuals."
