    "explanation": "Although the text references past aggressive actions (travel ban, attacks on media), the primary framing of the current event is a shift toward moderation and unity. There are no participants explicitly framed as Instigators, Tyrants, or Terrorists driving active violence or hatred in this specific narrative context; instead, the focus is on legislative debate and political division."
