{
  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "The text does not portray any participant as a guardian of values, peacemaker, or virtuous figure maintaining social cohesion. While local businesses are described as beneficial to the economy, they are not framed through the lens of moral authority or justice maintenance."
