    "explanation": "While the text discusses diplomatic efforts, no participant is framed as an underdog, rebel, or martyr sacrificing for systemic change against oppression. The actors are engaged in standard geopolitical negotiation and enforcement rather than revolutionary or sacrificial altruism."
