    "explanation": "While the organizers describe themselves as driving change, the narrative framing focuses on political opposition and mobilization against a specific ideology (Sharia Law) rather than challenging oppression for liberation or enduring hardship for a greater good in the archetypal sense of Rebels or Underdogs fighting systemic injustice."
