  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "John Banzhaf is framed as a Guardian/Peacemaker who utilizes established legal values and mediation (lawsuits) to maintain social order and safety. He advocates for 'detering illegal protests' through civil damages rather than physical violence, positioning himself as a proponent of justice and the rule of law ('more American way of deterring'). The text also frames Trump supporters as potential victims needing protection from 'increased violence,' aligning with the Guardian role."
  },
  "Altruistic_Catalysts": {
    "is_used": "No",
