  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "The text does not frame any participant as operating through secrecy, betrayal, or misinformation. While hackers are mentioned, they are described in terms of their capability to cause harm (hacking) rather than engaging in espionage, conspiracy, or deception for geopolitical subversion in the specific sense defined by the Deceptive Subversive category."
  },
