  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "Although Jeffrey Lord is described as holding 'terrible revisionist history' and being 'misinformed,' this is framed as ignorance rather than malicious secrecy, betrayal, or strategic manipulation typical of Deceptive Subversives like Conspirators or Spies."
  },
